<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets warrants on SIG AG.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets warrants on SIG AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank J. Vontobel &amp; Co AG said it has issued one million American-style call warrants, on SIG Schweizerische Industrie-Gesellschaft Holding AG registered shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2300 CHF		  PREMIUM	17.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.20 CHF		  GEARING	13.1 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 04.JUN.97-30.APR.98   PAYDATE	04.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2100 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
